
                       geant4-11-04-ref-08
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Simplified and optimised code in G4Tubs, G4CutTubs and G4Cons, boosting
   overall performance for phi-section configurations.
 o Accelerated polycone/polyhedra queries for large, stepped and non-convex RZ
   profiles and more code improvements.
 o Accelerated sphere/torus queries by replacing atan2-based phi checks, use
   a scale-normalised analytical Newton quartic in torus and simplifying code.
 o Account for electron mass in sampling and kinematics of G4MuonDecayChannel
   daughters, with improved kinematic endpoint/singularity handling.
 o Fixed thread safety issues in G4FermiBreakUpAN de-excitation hadronic model.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------


Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

geometry
--------
- management (geommng-V11-04-11)
  o Exposed G4VSolid::EstimateSurfaceArea() through G4UAdapter, resolving its
    ambiguity with VecGeom shapes.
- solids/CSG (geom-csg-V11-04-03)
  o G4Tubs, G4CutTubs and G4Cons: replaced atan2-based phi checks with cached
    phi-plane predicates in Inside(), surface-normal and DistanceToOut()
    queries. Simplified code overall in those queries.
    Navigation benchmark averages improved by 1.8x for G4Tubs, 1.7x for
    G4CutTubs and 1.6x for G4Cons, using different topology configurations.
  o In G4Torus, use a scale-normalised analytical quartic with Newton polishing
    and residual validation for exact-distance queries, retaining Jenkins-Traub
    as a fallback. Use fixed-size root buffers and cached phi trigonometry
    throughout. Fixed selection of the VecGeom wrapper by removing the obsolete
    G4GEOM_USE_SYS_USOLIDS guard. In G4UTorus wrapper, rebuild all VecGeom
    derived state when setters are used, preserving phi wedges and bounds for
    parameterised solids.
  o In G4Sphere and G4Torus, replaced atan2-based phi checks with cached
    predicates in Inside() and surface-normal queries; also use the predicate
    when filtering exact G4Torus intersections. Removed the remaining
    atan2-based angular checks using cached cone/wedge predicates and monotonic
    polar-angle comparisons. In G4Sphere, avoid computing the point theta angle
    in DistanceToIn() for solids without theta cuts.
    Code cleanup, removed obsolete branches, redundant temporary arrays,
    repeated phi trigonometry and verbose safety calculations. Expressed theta
    safeties directly as cone-plane distances.
    Speedup mean over all benchmarked queries improved by 2.26x for G4Sphere
    and 5.00x for G4Torus.
- solids/specific (geom-specific-V11-04-10)
  o Accelerated polycone/polyhedra queries for large, stepped and non-convex RZ
    profiles using indexed candidate traversal, with exact faceted fallbacks.
  o Added a compact exact-distance kernel for full-phi, two-plane G4Polycone,
    including hollow profiles, while retaining the general faceted fallback.
  o Use direct or binary Z-segment lookup for monotonic standard polycones.
  o Apply more aggressive inlining, where feasible.
  o Improved timings of 62.6% and 59.9% for full-phi, two-plane G4Polycone
    DistanceToIn(p,v) and DistanceToOut(p,v), respectively. For 100 Z planes,
    Inside(p) is 69.5% lower and all G4Polycone queries average 18.5% lower.
  o Restricted G4Polycone, G4Polyhedra and G4GenericPolycone RZ fast paths
    to profiles where their signed RZ safety/normal classification is
    semantically equivalent to the faceted implementation.
    Added supporting-boundary convexity checks for RZ profiles; allow ordered
    z-plane fast paths for G4Polycone and closed-phi G4Polyhedra while keeping
    open G4Polyhedra sectors on the faceted path. Fixes CMS navigation
    regressions from unsafe RZ shortcuts while preserving performance gains
    for regular monotonic and convex profiles.
  o Removed obsolete G4GEOM_USE_SYS_USOLIDS guards from the VecGeom wrappers
    for G4Ellipsoid, G4EllipticalCone, G4EllipticalTube, G4Hype and
    G4Paraboloid, enabling their replacement when GEANT4_USE_USOLIDS is set
    to ALL. Corrected the include ordering in G4EllipticalCone so its
    wrapper-selection macro is defined before guarding the native
    implementation.
  o Fixed stale polyhedra after dimension or visualisation changes in the
    VecGeom wrappers for G4Ellipsoid, G4EllipticalCone, G4EllipticalTube,
    G4GenericTrap and G4Paraboloid, and while building or finalising
    G4TessellatedSolid. Applied the matching visualisation-subdivision fix to
    native G4GenericTrap.
  o Added the missing parameterisation dispatch to G4UEllipsoid and corrected
    G4UHype bounding limits to use the outer end radius.

